1
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:05,660
Hey, guys.
大家好

2
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:09,670
So, what do you think?
你們覺得怎麼樣？

3
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,130
-About what? -What?
-你是指什麼？ -什麼？

4
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:16,770
Are you kidding? Okay,I'll give you a hint.
你在開玩笑嗎？ 好吧，我給你們一個提示

5
00:00:19,410 --> 00:00:20,400
Eyes.
眼睛

6
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,480
No,no. Your eyes! No.
不，你的眼睛，不

7
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:24,410
Chandler's eyes!
錢德的眼睛

8
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,320
I got glasses.
我戴上了眼鏡

9
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,920
You always had glasses.
你一直都戴著眼鏡

10
00:00:32,790 --> 00:00:34,320
No, I didn't.
我才沒有

11
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,130
Are you sure?
你確定？

12
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:40,130
Didn't you have a pair?
以前你沒有戴眼鏡嗎？

13
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:44,570
They were really round and burgundy, and they made you look kind of...
你戴著圓形酒紅色的眼鏡 看起來有一點…

14
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:46,770
-Feminine. -Yes!
-娘娘腔 -對

15
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:48,170
No.
不

16
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:51,170
I think the glasses look great. You look sexy.
我覺得你很適合戴眼鏡 你看起來很性感

17
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:52,880
-Really? -Yeah.
-真的嗎？ -對

18
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:55,210
You didn't think I wore glasses?
你也以為以前我有戴眼鏡嗎？

19
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:57,010
Of course.
當然不是

20
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:03,120
The One With Phoebe's Cookies
本集播出：菲比的食譜

00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:06,120
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

21
00:01:53,370 --> 00:01:55,500
What do you want for an engagement gift?
你們要什麼訂婚禮物？

22
00:01:55,740 --> 00:01:57,770
That's okay, we're not having a party...
沒關係，我們不辦派對…

23
00:01:58,050 --> 00:01:59,950
so you don't have to get us..
所以你們不必送我們…

24
00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:04,940
If someone wants to give us a present, we can't deprive them of that joy.
如果有人想送我們禮物 我們不該剝奪他們的快樂

25
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:08,450
You should get them a little CD player.
你應該送他們攜帶型CD機

26
00:02:08,690 --> 00:02:09,920
I already have one.
我已經有一台了

27
00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:13,690
Unless someone borrowed it and left it at the gynecologist.
但有人借走 把它忘在婦產科診所

28
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:20,360
Yeah, and by "someone" she means Joey.
對，至於「那個人」 她指的是喬伊

29
00:02:21,770 --> 00:02:23,070
I know what I want!
我知道我要什麼

30
00:02:23,340 --> 00:02:26,100
-What we want, honey. -No,you don't want this.
-是我們要什麼，甜心 -不，你不要這個禮物

31
00:02:27,110 --> 00:02:29,770
I want your grandmother's cookie recipe.
我要你奶奶的餅乾食譜

32
00:02:30,010 --> 00:02:32,340
You mean the chocolate chip cookie recipe?
你是說 巧克力碎片餅乾的食譜嗎？

33
00:02:33,620 --> 00:02:35,910
The one my grandma made me swear on her deathbed...
我奶奶臨死前 要我發誓…

34
00:02:36,180 --> 00:02:38,850
that I would never let out of our family?
絕不會洩露給外人的餅乾食譜？

35
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:42,680
Dying people say the craziest things.
快死的人都會胡言亂語

36
00:02:44,230 --> 00:02:47,660
I've wanted it for years. I was gonna make cookies for my children.
多年來我一直都想得到它 我想幫我的孩子們做餅乾

37
00:02:48,730 --> 00:02:51,260
Break my heart. Oh, all right.
我真的很難過，好吧

38
00:02:51,530 --> 00:02:55,030
I'll be the mom who makes the world's best chocolate chip cookies.
我要當能做出全世界 最好吃餅乾的媽媽

39
00:02:55,270 --> 00:02:58,540
Our kids are gonna be fat, aren't they?
我們的孩子會是胖子，對吧？

40
00:03:00,510 --> 00:03:02,030
Ahoy!
你們好

41
00:03:02,310 --> 00:03:04,970
-How's the boat? -I'm getting into this sailing stuff.
-駕帆船出海還好玩吧？ -我開始喜歡駕駛帆船了

42
00:03:05,210 --> 00:03:07,110
You finally took it out of the marina?
這次你終於出海了？

43
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,150
Why would I do that?
我為什麼要那麼做？

44
00:03:09,850 --> 00:03:12,720
It took three guys to get the thing in there.
三個彪形大漢使出吃奶的力氣 才把它漂在海上

45
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,650
If you don't sail it, what do you do on it?
如果你不想開它出海 你在船上都做些什麼呢？

46
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:17,650
It's a great place to just sit...
光是坐在那裡就很舒服了…

47
00:03:17,890 --> 00:03:21,350
hang around,drink a few beers, eat some chips.
我什麼都不做，喝啤酒 吃洋芋片

48
00:03:22,900 --> 00:03:26,160
It's good that you finally have a place to do that.
恭喜你終於找到 能那麼做的地方了

49
00:03:26,970 --> 00:03:29,230
I could teach you to sail if you want.
如果你要的話，我可以教你駕駛帆船

50
00:03:29,470 --> 00:03:31,730
-You could? -I've been sailing my whole life.
-你會駕駛帆船？ -我從小就會

51
00:03:32,010 --> 00:03:35,030
When I was 15,my dad bought me my own boat.
我十五歲時 我爸送我一艘帆船

52
00:03:36,540 --> 00:03:38,670
-Your own boat? -He was trying to cheer me up.
-你有一艘帆船？ -他想要安慰我

53
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:40,540
My pony was sick.
我的小馬生病了

54
00:03:47,460 --> 00:03:48,654
（中央公園咖啡廳）

55
00:03:52,130 --> 00:03:54,250
-You know what I was thinking? -What?
-你知道我在想什麼嗎？ -什麼？

56
00:03:54,730 --> 00:03:56,820
Nothing,I just like to go like this.
沒事，我只是想這麼做

57
00:03:58,630 --> 00:04:01,120
-What are you doing tonight? -Do you have a lecture?
-今晚你要做什麼？ -你有課嗎？

58
00:04:01,370 --> 00:04:04,530
-No, why? -Then, free as a bird. What's up?
-沒有啊，怎麼了？ -那麼我沒事，怎麼了？

59
00:04:04,770 --> 00:04:07,500
My dad wants to know if you want to play racquetball.
我爸想約你去打回力球

60
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:09,470
Great! Dad must like you!
太棒了，爸一定很喜歡你

61
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,370
He doesn't ask just anyone to play.
他從來不會約人去打回力球

62
00:04:11,610 --> 00:04:13,840
He didn't ask for you. He asked for "Chauncey."
他沒有約你 他要約「小錢」

63
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:16,350
I assumed he meant you.
我猜他應該是指你

64
00:04:16,990 --> 00:04:18,450
Did you correct him?
你糾正他了嗎？

65
00:04:18,690 --> 00:04:21,210
No,I thought it would be more fun this way.
沒有，我覺得那樣子比較好玩

66
00:04:22,690 --> 00:04:25,120
Cool! Maybe you could do this every week.
太酷了，或許你們每星期都該這麼做

67
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,620
Or you could sit on the porch...
你也可以坐在走廊上…

68
00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:28,990
and make sure no one steals the trashcans.
確定垃圾桶不會被偷走

69
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,720
He does that every week too.
他每星期都會這麼做

70
00:04:33,100 --> 00:04:36,900
Just so you know, you have to let him win. He hates to lose.
你得讓他贏，他最討厭輸了

71
00:04:37,170 --> 00:04:39,540
Maybe I'll play with my left hand.
或許我該用左手打球

72
00:04:40,710 --> 00:04:42,040
You're not a lefty?
你不是左撇子嗎？

73
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,170
Does anybody know me?
有人認識我嗎？

74
00:04:50,220 --> 00:04:51,210
What's wrong?
怎麼了？

75
00:04:51,490 --> 00:04:54,850
I went to my old apartment to get the cookie recipe...
我到以前的公寓拿餅乾食譜…

76
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:57,550
and that stupid fire burned it up!
那場愚蠢的大火把它燒了

77
00:04:57,760 --> 00:05:01,630
No! Why didn't you make a copy and keep it in a fireproof box...
不！ 你為什麼沒有影印一份 把它放在防火的盒子裡…

78
00:05:01,860 --> 00:05:04,860
and keep it at least 100 yards away from the original?
將盒子放在離起火點 至少一百碼的地方？

79
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:13,170
Because I'm normal.
因為我是個凡人

80
00:05:14,940 --> 00:05:17,500
That was the one legacy my grandmother left me.
那是我奶奶留給我的傳奇

81
00:05:17,750 --> 00:05:20,540
And I know you wanted it as an engagement present.
我知道你要它當你的訂婚禮物

82
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:22,910
We have to get you an engagement present?
我們得送你們訂婚禮物？

83
00:05:23,890 --> 00:05:25,150
Don't worry about it.
別擔心

84
00:05:25,350 --> 00:05:27,880
No one got me an engagement present.
沒有人送我訂婚禮物

85
00:05:28,590 --> 00:05:32,050
I don't have the recipe, but here.
我沒有食譜，但這個給你

86
00:05:32,290 --> 00:05:34,730
I wish you health and happiness.
祝你們健康快樂

87
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:37,460
An old cookie?
一塊放了很久的餅乾？

88
00:05:38,770 --> 00:05:41,230
This is what happens when you don't register for gifts.
不列出禮物清單 就是會發生這種事

89
00:05:42,540 --> 00:05:47,240
I made a batch and froze it. This is the only one left.
我做了一些餅乾，把它們冷凍起來 這是最後一塊

90
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:48,700
We can't accept this.
我們不能收下它

91
00:05:48,910 --> 00:05:49,900
Why not?
為什麼？

92
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:52,900
Cause it's gross.
因為它很噁心

93
00:05:53,610 --> 00:05:56,880
No, wait. I think I can figure out the recipe from this cookie.
不，等一下，我想我可以 利用這塊餅乾猜出整個食譜

94
00:05:57,090 --> 00:05:58,780
I do this at work all the time.
我在工作時常常這麼做

95
00:05:59,050 --> 00:06:00,180
-Really? -I think so!
-真的嗎？ -我想我可以做到

96
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:06,990
Okay, Ross, we owe you a present.
好吧，羅斯，我們欠你一份禮物

97
00:06:07,230 --> 00:06:09,590
Two! I've been engaged twice.
是兩份，我訂過兩次婚

98
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:20,070
Look at this clown.
快來看看這個小丑

99
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:23,570
He thinks he can take up the whole river.
他以為整條河都是他的

100
00:06:23,810 --> 00:06:26,470
Get out of the way, jackass!
別擋路，大混蛋

101
00:06:28,250 --> 00:06:30,910
Who names their boat Coast Guard,anyway?
誰會把自己的船 命名為海岸防衛隊？

102
00:06:33,620 --> 00:06:35,320
That is the Coast Guard.
因為他們就是海岸防衛隊

103
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:36,620
What are they doing here?
他們在這裡做什麼？

104
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:39,020
The coast is all the way over there.
海岸在那邊

105
00:06:39,930 --> 00:06:41,420
Joey, just ignore the boats.
喬伊，別管那些船

106
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:43,860
-We're not finished with our lesson. -All right.
-我們的課還沒有上完 -好吧

107
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:46,290
I'm gonna go over the basic points once more.
我要幫你複習一下基本要點

108
00:06:46,530 --> 00:06:48,500
Come on,Rach. I got it, okay?
別麻煩了，瑞秋，我已經懂了

109
00:06:48,770 --> 00:06:50,470
I want to go over there...
我想把船開到…

110
00:06:50,670 --> 00:06:52,970
where that boatload of girls is.
那一船小妞旁邊去

111
00:06:54,980 --> 00:06:57,000
Is that it? You want to give...
真的嗎？你想要…

112
00:06:57,250 --> 00:06:59,240
a shout to the hot chicas?
跟那些小妞鬼混？

113
00:06:59,450 --> 00:07:01,440
Okay, let's do that, Sailor Joe.
好了，來吧，水手喬伊

114
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:04,810
Quick question, though: What's this called?
快問快答，這叫什麼？

115
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:09,280
-Boat rope? -Wrong!
-船上的繩子？ -錯了

116
00:07:09,490 --> 00:07:11,320
How do you get the mainsail up?
要怎麼把主帆拉上去？

117
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,260
Rub it?
摸一下就行了？

118
00:07:17,470 --> 00:07:20,900
No. What do you do if I say we're coming about?
不，如果我說我們要轉向了 你該怎麼辦？

119
00:07:21,170 --> 00:07:24,040
I say, "Come again?"
我會說：「隨你轉？」

120
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:26,270
I know this one. I know this one.
我知道，這一題我會

121
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:30,310
Time's up. Now you're dead.
時間到，現在你死了

122
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:31,770
And deaf!
我也聾了

123
00:07:31,980 --> 00:07:33,910
You go on and make your little jokes.
你繼續開玩笑吧

124
00:07:34,150 --> 00:07:35,640
If you don't know what you're doing...
如果你不知道自己在做什麼…

125
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:39,150
you will die. Am I getting through to you?
你就會沒命，你聽懂了嗎？

126
00:07:40,590 --> 00:07:42,220
-Yes. -Don't just say yes.
-懂了 -別只是說你懂了

127
00:07:42,420 --> 00:07:44,910
This isn't a game. You could get hurt out here!
這不是遊戲 你很可能會受傷

128
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:47,990
Do you want to pay attention, or do you want to die?
你要注意聽我說話 還是想死呢？

129
00:07:51,330 --> 00:07:54,060
I want to make a ship-to-shore call to Chandler.
我想從船上就打電話給錢德

130
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:06,340
-I definitely taste nutmeg. -You do?
-我吃到了肉豆蔻 -真的嗎？

131
00:08:06,550 --> 00:08:09,020
You don't? Well, that's the difference...
你沒吃到嗎？那就是…

132
00:08:09,220 --> 00:08:11,380
between a professional and a layman.
專業人員跟外行人的不同

133
00:08:13,050 --> 00:08:14,750
That and arrogance.
沒錯，專業人員很傲慢

134
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:17,950
Hey.
嘿

135
00:08:18,190 --> 00:08:19,720
Hey. How was sailing?
嘿，駕駛帆船出海好玩嗎？

136
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:22,420
I don't want to talk about it.
我不想談這件事

137
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:25,360
You could've at least saved me a cookie.
你們至少可以留一塊餅乾給我

138
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,400
Women are mean!
女人太無情了

139
00:08:36,140 --> 00:08:37,370
I can't believe that.
我不敢相信

140
00:08:37,580 --> 00:08:40,950
Now the only thing left of my grandmother's legacy is...
現在我奶奶的傳奇 只剩下…

141
00:08:41,150 --> 00:08:42,710
this crumb.
這塊碎屑

142
00:08:44,620 --> 00:08:47,490
I wish you a long and happy marriage.
祝你們白頭偕老，婚姻美滿

143
00:08:50,590 --> 00:08:52,390
-Hey. -How was it?
-嘿 -怎麼樣？

144
00:08:52,590 --> 00:08:55,150
Well,I had a great time.
我玩得很開心

145
00:08:55,430 --> 00:08:57,760
Chauncey on the other hand...
但是小錢…

146
00:08:57,970 --> 00:08:59,960
I will tell the story.
讓我來說吧

147
00:09:00,230 --> 00:09:03,290
It was going great. I let him win, we were bonding...
我們相處甚歡 我放手讓他贏球，他喜歡我…

148
00:09:03,570 --> 00:09:05,400
he even said I could call him Dad.
甚至說我可以叫他爸爸

149
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:07,400
And what did he ask you not to call him?
他要你不能叫他什麼？

150
00:09:08,610 --> 00:09:09,800
"Daddy."
爹地

151
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:12,950
Look,here's the story.
聽著，事情是這樣的

152
00:09:13,810 --> 00:09:18,310
We had just finished playing, and we were gonna take a steam.
我們打完球，決定去做桑拿

153
00:09:18,590 --> 00:09:19,610
I walk into the room...
我走進蒸氣室…

154
00:09:19,820 --> 00:09:21,880
and it's really steamy.
裡面霧氣瀰漫

155
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:27,620
So I take off my glasses, and that's when it happened.
於是我拿下眼鏡 悲劇發生了

156
00:09:27,830 --> 00:09:28,890
Guys?
你們在哪裡？

157
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:31,990
-Over here. -Have a seat,son.
-這邊 -坐吧，孩子

158
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:38,260
Hey!
嘿

159
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:52,450
-Oh, my God! I can't believe it. -I know.
-我的天啊，我不敢相信 -我知道

160
00:09:52,650 --> 00:09:55,120
You gave my father a lap dance.
你坐在我爸的大腿上

161
00:09:58,530 --> 00:10:01,050
Why do they put so much steam in there?
他們為什麼 要把那裡弄的霧氣瀰漫？

162
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:07,360
Because otherwise they'd have to call it the "room" room.
不那麼做的話 那裡只能叫做「房間」

163
00:10:08,870 --> 00:10:12,930
Why? Why did that have to happen?
為什麼？ 為什麼會發生那種事？

164
00:10:13,740 --> 00:10:15,370
Come on,it's not that big a deal.
別這樣，那沒有什麼大不了的

165
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:17,940
Not that big a deal?
那沒有什麼大不了的？

166
00:10:18,210 --> 00:10:20,580
There was touching of things.
我有種異樣的感覺

167
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:22,940
I know you wanted to bond with my dad...
我知道你想跟我爸打好關係…

168
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:26,350
but did you have to bond to that part?
但你一定要從他那個地方開始嗎？

169
00:10:29,660 --> 00:10:31,350
I'm sure Dad doesn't care.
我相信爸不會在乎的

170
00:10:31,590 --> 00:10:33,080
He probably thought it was funny.
或許他會覺得很好笑

171
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:35,090
He'll be telling this story for years.
他會把這個故事掛在嘴邊

172
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:38,090
I don't want him to tell this story for years.
我就是不希望 他把這個故事掛在嘴邊

173
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:40,700
Oh,but he will.
他會那麼做的

174
00:10:41,540 --> 00:10:45,600
He still tells the story about how Monica tried to escape from fat camp.
他還是會告訴大家 摩妮卡試圖逃出減肥營的故事

175
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:48,570
I wasn't escaping.
我才沒有那麼做

176
00:10:48,780 --> 00:10:51,040
Then how'd you get caught in the barbed wire?
那麼你怎麼會 被卡在鐵絲網上的？

177
00:10:52,210 --> 00:10:53,910
I was trying to help out a squirrel.
我想要救一隻松鼠

178
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:55,910
You were trying to eat it.
你想吃掉他

179
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:02,080
If that is your father calling to tell this story...
如果是你爸打電話來 告訴你這件事…

180
00:11:02,290 --> 00:11:04,050
then the marriage is off!
那麼我們的婚禮就取消了

181
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:06,620
Come on. Hello.
別這樣，喂

182
00:11:07,330 --> 00:11:09,690
I'm sorry, you have the wrong number.
對不起，你打錯電話了

183
00:11:09,930 --> 00:11:11,830
I'll call you later, Dad. I love you.
我待會回你電話，爸 我愛你

184
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:20,110
I'm off to see your dad.
我要去見你爸

185
00:11:20,940 --> 00:11:22,340
Aren't you a little overdressed?
你不會穿太多了嗎？

186
00:11:24,310 --> 00:11:27,800
You better make sure he tips you this time.
你最好確定 這次他會付你小費

187
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:32,220
I figured I would try to convince him not to tell the story anymore...
我想說服他 別再提那件事…

188
00:11:32,450 --> 00:11:35,320
and I figured the best way to do that was face to face.
我想最好的辦法 就是跟他面對面談一談

189
00:11:35,590 --> 00:11:38,080
And by "face," I don't mean his lap.
我說的「面對面」，指的不是他的大腿

190
00:11:38,330 --> 00:11:41,160
And by "face," I don't mean my ass.
我說的「面對面」，指的不是我的屁股

191
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:46,760
Are you getting Monica and Chandler a present?
你要送摩妮卡跟錢德禮物？

192
00:11:46,970 --> 00:11:49,330
I don't know. You know, they didn't get us anything.
我不知道 他們沒有送我們禮物

193
00:11:49,540 --> 00:11:51,160
Thank you!
謝謝你

194
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,300
Hey.
嘿

195
00:11:54,810 --> 00:11:56,040
Well,hello.
嗨

196
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:59,140
So when are we getting back out on the water, matey?
我們什麼時候要再出航？夥伴

197
00:12:00,310 --> 00:12:03,550
I don't know the boat way to say this, but, never.
我不知道水手是怎麼說的 但我死都不要

198
00:12:05,490 --> 00:12:06,510
Why not?
為什麼？

199
00:12:06,750 --> 00:12:09,120
Because you're mean on the boat.
因為你在船上很凶

200
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:11,550
I was just trying to teach you.
我只是想教會你

201
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:14,190
Well,lesson learned. Rachel is mean.
我的確學會了教訓 那就是瑞秋很凶

202
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:18,290
Yep, yep, yep.
對，沒錯

203
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:21,530
I remember when she took me out on her dad's boat.
我還記得她駕駛她爸的船 帶我出海

204
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:23,670
She wouldn't let me help at all.
她完全不讓我插手

205
00:12:23,870 --> 00:12:25,840
Excuse me, I wanted you to help.
對不起，我要你幫我

206
00:12:26,070 --> 00:12:27,270
But you couldn't move...
但你連動都動不了…

207
00:12:27,510 --> 00:12:30,480
because you were wearing three life jackets.
因為你穿了三件救生衣

208
00:12:31,710 --> 00:12:34,550
You have to respect the sea.
我們得敬畏大海

209
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:38,780
Joey,I'm sorry if you thought that was mean.
喬伊，如果你覺得我很凶 對不起

210
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:41,040
But I tell you, that was not mean.
但我告訴你，我一點都不凶

211
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:45,190
My father is mean. He used to always yell at me on the boat.
我爸才凶，以前在船上 他總會對我大吼大叫

212
00:12:45,430 --> 00:12:48,520
It was horrible. I was being a really good teacher.
那真的很可怕 我是個很棒的老師

213
00:12:48,730 --> 00:12:51,600
Does a good teacher say, "Put down the beer,pinhead!"
好老師會說： 「把啤酒放下，豬頭」？

214
00:12:52,370 --> 00:12:55,860
Does a good student drink 7 beers during his first lesson?
好學生會在上第一堂課時 喝掉七罐啤酒？

215
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:57,600
Six and a half.
是六罐半

216
00:12:58,170 --> 00:13:00,110
You knocked the last one out of my hand, remember?
你把最後一罐從我手裡 敲掉，還記得嗎？

217
00:13:00,340 --> 00:13:02,240
I didn't want you to get hit by the boom.
我不希望你被船桅打中

218
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,810
Well,it hit me anyway.
它的確打中我了

219
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:07,210
It would have hurt a lot less if I had finished that last beer.
如果我能喝完最後一罐啤酒 或許不會那麼痛

220
00:13:08,220 --> 00:13:13,350
I'm sorry. I will try to tone it down and stop yelling.
對不起，我會試著小聲點 不再對你大吼大叫

221
00:13:14,050 --> 00:13:15,420
No bossing me around?
你不會再使喚我？

222
00:13:15,690 --> 00:13:17,420
-I won't boss you around. -And be nice?
-我不會再使喚你 -你會對我很好？

223
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:19,320
-I'll be nice. -You'll be topless?
-我會對你很好 -你會脫掉上衣？

224
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:22,890
-Joey! -You want me to learn?
-喬伊 -你希望我學會嗎？

225
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:32,340
Here's batch 22. Maybe these are like your grandma's.
這是二十二號 或許它們跟你奶奶的餅乾味道很像

226
00:13:32,570 --> 00:13:35,440
This has a bit of orange peel, but no nutmeg.
我放了一些橘子皮 沒有放肉豆蔻

227
00:13:35,710 --> 00:13:37,340
Let's give it a shot.
我們來試吃吧

228
00:13:37,780 --> 00:13:40,270
I haven't made so many cookies since 9th grade.
自從九年級後 我再也沒做過這麼多餅乾

229
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:42,070
What for, a bake sale?
你為了義賣會做那麼多餅乾嗎？

230
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:44,220
No, just a Friday night.
不，那是我星期五晚上要吃的

231
00:13:49,890 --> 00:13:51,150
These are pretty good.
這些餅乾真的很好吃

232
00:13:51,390 --> 00:13:53,290
Yeah, but not as good as batch 17.
對，但沒有十七號好吃

233
00:13:53,490 --> 00:13:54,550
Which one was that?
十七號是哪一塊？

234
00:13:54,730 --> 00:13:56,860
The ones we had after you almost threw up.
你幾乎快吐出來後 吃的那塊餅乾

235
00:13:57,900 --> 00:14:00,030
Oh, yeah, batch 17 was good.
對，十七號很好吃

236
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:03,360
I did not like batch 16.
我不喜歡十六號

237
00:14:04,870 --> 00:14:06,460
I'm okay.
我沒事

238
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:10,940
Any more from the good batch? We could work off those.
十七號還有剩嗎？ 我們可以好好研究一下

239
00:14:11,150 --> 00:14:14,600
I think there's one left.
我想應該還剩一塊

240
00:14:19,050 --> 00:14:22,550
Batch 16. Sixteen, people, get out of the way!
十六號 這是十六號，別擋路

241
00:14:29,930 --> 00:14:33,800
Okay, Joey. You're doing really good.
喬伊，你表現得很好

242
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:36,160
I just need you to step to the portside.
我要你站到左舷去

243
00:14:41,510 --> 00:14:44,000
Remember talking about the portside?
還記得左舷是哪一邊嗎？

244
00:14:44,250 --> 00:14:45,770
Oh,yeah.
當然

245
00:14:45,980 --> 00:14:47,140
No.
不

246
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:52,510
It's left, sweetie, but that's okay. That's a tough one.
是左邊，甜心，但沒關係 那一題太難了

247
00:14:52,750 --> 00:14:54,150
Why not just say left?
為什麼不乾脆說左邊就好了呢？

248
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:56,120
Okay,go to the left.
好吧，到左邊去

249
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:02,460
The left.
左邊

250
00:15:02,660 --> 00:15:03,690
Just sit over there!
坐在那邊

251
00:15:03,930 --> 00:15:06,090
You're yelling again. See that?
看到沒？你又在大吼大叫了

252
00:15:06,300 --> 00:15:10,260
Oh,no,no. Very quiet. Said with love, no yelling.
不，我很小聲 語氣充滿了愛意，我沒有大吼大叫

253
00:15:12,540 --> 00:15:13,530
You know what?
你知道了？

254
00:15:13,810 --> 00:15:17,400
Since I'm here,I'm gonna have a beer on the portside.
既然我已經坐在這裡 我要在左舷喝一罐啤酒

255
00:15:18,710 --> 00:15:20,410
See what I did there?
你看到我剛剛做了什麼嗎？

256
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:27,150
We're luffing a little. Can you tighten up the Cunningham?
風有點大 麻煩你把船繩拉緊

257
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:31,520
You just said a bunch of stuff I don't know.
你說了一堆我聽不懂的話

258
00:15:31,730 --> 00:15:34,420
Joey,come on! We just went over this.
喬伊，別這樣 我剛剛才教過你

259
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:36,600
We did that when that bird...
你教我的時候 有隻鳥嘴巴裡…

260
00:15:36,860 --> 00:15:38,890
flew over with the fish in his mouth.
銜著魚飛過去

261
00:15:39,130 --> 00:15:40,790
Did you see it? It was gross.
你看到了嗎？那真的很噁心

262
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:43,090
I did not see the bird or the fish!
我沒有看到鳥或魚

263
00:15:43,370 --> 00:15:46,400
I did not see the piece of Styrofoam shaped like Mike Tyson!
也沒看到形狀像泰森的保麗龍

264
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:51,870
I did not, because I was trying to teach you how to sail a boat.
我沒有看到 因為我忙著教你駕駛帆船

265
00:15:52,110 --> 00:15:54,910
Which obviously is an impossible thing to do.
很明顯地 那是不可能的

266
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:58,210
You're yelling, and I don't see you taking your top off.
你在大吼大叫 而且你沒有脫掉上衣

267
00:15:58,450 --> 00:15:59,940
I quit!
我放棄了

268
00:16:00,890 --> 00:16:04,020
-What do you mean? You can't quit. -Why not?
-你是什麼意思？你不能放棄 -為什麼？

269
00:16:04,220 --> 00:16:07,130
You're not finished! I won't have it. Greenes do not quit.
你還沒有學會，我不准你那麼做 葛林家的人不會放棄

270
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:09,760
Greenes?
葛林家的人？

271
00:16:10,060 --> 00:16:13,090
I'm a Tribbiani. Tribbianis quit.
我姓崔比亞尼 崔比亞尼家的人會放棄

272
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:17,600
Oh, my God.
我的天啊

273
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:20,810
I just said, "Greenes don't quit," didn't I?
剛剛我說 葛林家的人不會放棄，對吧？

274
00:16:21,040 --> 00:16:22,300
Did I say, "Greenes don't quit"?
我到底說了沒有？

275
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:25,570
Yes! And you're still yelling at me.
對，你還在對我大吼大叫

276
00:16:25,780 --> 00:16:28,750
No,I'm not yelling at you. I'm just yelling near you.
不，我沒有對你大吼大叫 我是對你身邊的空氣大吼大叫

277
00:16:28,950 --> 00:16:30,810
Oh, God, Joey. I'm my father.
天啊，喬伊，我就跟我爸一樣

278
00:16:31,090 --> 00:16:33,750
Oh,my God. This is horrible.
天啊，這真的太可怕了

279
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:38,760
I try so hard not to be my mother, I didn't see this coming.
我很努力不要跟我媽一樣 卻沒有提防到這一點

280
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:46,470
I'm so sorry. I just wanted you to learn.
我真的很抱歉 我只希望你能學會駕駛帆船

281
00:16:51,340 --> 00:16:52,700
I did learn.
我的確學會了

282
00:16:52,940 --> 00:16:56,340
-Really? -Yeah, come on.
-真的嗎？ -沒錯，來吧

283
00:16:56,580 --> 00:16:58,100
It's okay.
沒關係的

284
00:16:58,310 --> 00:17:00,210
I know what a mainsail is.
我知道主帆是什麼

285
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:04,820
I know to duck when the boom comes across.
我知道船桅過來時 一定要低頭

286
00:17:06,590 --> 00:17:08,110
-I know port is right. -Left.
-我知道左舷是右邊 -左邊才對

287
00:17:08,320 --> 00:17:09,620
Damn it!
該死

288
00:17:12,860 --> 00:17:15,330
It would make my grandmother happy...
我們試著研究出她的食譜…

289
00:17:15,530 --> 00:17:18,460
that we're trying to figure out her recipe.
這會讓我奶奶覺得開心

290
00:17:18,700 --> 00:17:23,160
I bet she's looking up at us and smiling right now.
我敢說她正抬頭看著我們 對我們微笑

291
00:17:24,740 --> 00:17:26,600
Looking up?
抬頭看我們？

292
00:17:26,770 --> 00:17:31,370
She was really nice to me but she's in hell for sure.
她對我真的很好 但現在她一定在地獄裡

293
00:17:33,210 --> 00:17:34,340
Well,I've tried everything.
我已經努力過了

294
00:17:34,620 --> 00:17:36,310
I give up. I'm not gonna be the mom...
我放棄，我沒辦法成為…

295
00:17:36,580 --> 00:17:38,210
who makes the world's best cookies.
做出全世界 最好吃餅乾的媽媽

296
00:17:38,820 --> 00:17:43,650
I do make the best duck confit with broccoli raab.
但我會做最好吃的 花椰菜配油封鴨

297
00:17:43,890 --> 00:17:45,090
Kids love that,right?
小孩子很喜歡吃那道菜吧？

298
00:17:47,660 --> 00:17:50,720
Isn't there any relative that has the recipe?
難道你家的親戚 都沒有食譜嗎？

299
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,470
What about your sister?
你妹妹呢？

300
00:17:52,670 --> 00:17:55,500
No. I made a promise to myself that the next time...
不，我跟自己發誓…

301
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:58,830
I would talk to Ursula is over my dead body.
除非我死掉 不然我不會跟烏蘇拉說話

302
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:04,870
And that's not happening till October 15,2032.
那一天將會是 2032年10月15日

303
00:18:05,150 --> 00:18:07,380
That's the day you're gonna die?
那天你會死掉？

304
00:18:07,650 --> 00:18:09,710
I've got shuffleboard that day.
那天我要去玩推圓盤遊戲

305
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,310
That's what you think.
你少做夢了

306
00:18:16,990 --> 00:18:18,480
What about friends of your grandma?
你奶奶的朋友呢？ 

307
00:18:18,730 --> 00:18:19,850
Wouldn't they have the recipe?
他們沒有食譜嗎？

308
00:18:20,060 --> 00:18:24,160
I may have relatives in France who would know.
我在法國的親戚，可能有人知道

309
00:18:24,360 --> 00:18:29,430
My grandmother said she got it from her grandmother, "Nestley Toulouse."
我奶奶說食譜是她奶奶 「鳥巢」傳給她的

310
00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:32,330
What was her name?
她叫什麼名字？

311
00:18:33,070 --> 00:18:35,740
Nestley Toulouse.
鳥巢

312
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:39,910
Nestle Tollhouse?
雀巢？

313
00:18:45,190 --> 00:18:47,850
You Americans always butcher the French language.
美國人就是 沒辦法說好法文

314
00:18:49,790 --> 00:18:52,280
Phoebe, is this the recipe?
菲比，這是你奶奶的食譜嗎？

315
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:56,190
Yes!
對

316
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:00,460
Oh.
喔

317
00:19:01,070 --> 00:19:02,870
I cannot believe that I spent...
我不敢相信…

318
00:19:03,070 --> 00:19:05,200
two days figuring out that recipe.
我花了兩天時間研究那份食譜

319
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:06,870
It was here the whole time!
結果它一直在這裡

320
00:19:07,070 --> 00:19:10,980
I know! You see, it is stuff like this...
我知道 就是這樣的事情…

321
00:19:11,250 --> 00:19:13,710
which is why you're burning in hell!
害得你得在地獄裡受苦

322
00:19:18,050 --> 00:19:19,040
So you understand.
那麼你懂了

323
00:19:19,250 --> 00:19:21,810
I'd feel better if you didn't tell what happened.
如果你可以不把那件事說出去 我會覺得舒服一點

324
00:19:22,060 --> 00:19:24,890
I'm a little embarrassed about it.
我覺得很不好意思

325
00:19:25,130 --> 00:19:27,060
I understand completely.
我完全瞭解

326
00:19:27,290 --> 00:19:29,850
Nothing's scarier than embarrassing yourself...
最可怕的事莫過於... 

327
00:19:30,030 --> 00:19:31,020
in front of your in-laws.
在丈人跟丈母娘面前丟臉

328
00:19:31,270 --> 00:19:35,460
As a matter of fact, when I started dating Judy, I was unemployed.
事實上我開始跟茱蒂交往時 根本就沒有工作

329
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:37,970
Her father asked me what I did for a living.
她爸問我是幹哪一行的

330
00:19:38,210 --> 00:19:39,970
I said I was a lawyer.
我說我是律師

331
00:19:40,410 --> 00:19:42,640
-What'd you do when they found out? -They never did.
-他們發現事實後你怎麼辦？ -他們一直都沒有發現

332
00:19:42,840 --> 00:19:46,640
So if you ever see me giving them legal advice, just nod along.
如果你看到我在幫他們做法律咨詢 只要點頭就行了

333
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,340
Shall we?
我們可以進去了嗎？

334
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:07,300
So,I guess we wear swimsuits in here.
我猜這裡得穿泳裝才能進來

335
00:20:19,850 --> 00:20:23,110
Well,Joey,I hate to admit it...
喬伊，我得承認…

336
00:20:23,320 --> 00:20:25,840
your way of sailing is a lot more fun.
你的航海方式 真的有趣多了

337
00:20:28,490 --> 00:20:31,690
Why don't you give a pull on that rope?
你為什麼不拉一下那條繩子？

338
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:33,020
We're not sailing.
我們沒有要出海

339
00:20:33,290 --> 00:20:36,460
-Just pull on it. -All right.
-拉一下 -好吧

340
00:20:41,340 --> 00:20:42,890
Sandwiches!
三明治

341
00:20:43,140 --> 00:20:44,690
What else?
不然會是什麼呢？

342
00:20:45,840 --> 00:20:47,270
Here you go.
這個給你

343
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:49,630
-Thank you. -Oh,wow.
-謝謝 -哇

344
00:20:53,350 --> 00:20:55,140
-What are you doing? -Sorry.
-你在做什麼？ -對不起

345
00:20:55,380 --> 00:20:58,680
Not like that. You're letting all the good stuff fall out.
別那樣 好料的都掉在地上了

346
00:20:58,990 --> 00:21:02,850
Careful! You're wasting good pastrami!
小心 你浪費了好吃的醃熏牛肉

347
00:21:05,730 --> 00:21:08,420
Oh,my God. I'm my dad!
天啊，我就跟我爸一樣

348
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


349
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
